{"pair_id":"spk_001_000001","speaker_id":"spk_001","gender":"male","original_source_speaker":"jellyfish1010_0046","vi_audio":"speakers\/spk_001\/vi\/000001.wav","vi_text":"Đồng thời, tăng huyết áp lâu ngày có thể gây ra tổn thương cho lớp nội mạc của thành động mạch, làm cho các tế bào trong thành mạch bị hư hại.","vi_duration":7.45,"en_audio":"speakers\/spk_001\/en\/000001.mp3","en_text":"At the same time, prolonged hypertension can cause damage to the inner lining of the arterial wall, damaging cells within the blood vessels.","en_duration":8.41,"reference_audio_ids":["spk_001_ref_combined","spk_001_ref_01","spk_001_ref_02","spk_001_ref_03","spk_001_ref_04","spk_001_ref_05","spk_001_ref_06","spk_001_ref_07","spk_001_ref_08","spk_001_ref_09"],"translation_model":"NLLB-200 \/ Helsinki-NLP","dubbing_provider":"ElevenLabs","dubbing_model":"eleven_multilingual_v2","speaker_similarity_vi_en":0.9813,"split":"train"}
{"pair_id":"spk_001_000002","speaker_id":"spk_001","gender":"male","original_source_speaker":"jellyfish1010_0046","vi_audio":"speakers\/spk_001\/vi\/000002.wav","vi_text":"Bệnh tim bẩm sinh ở người lớn, ACHD, là thuật ngữ chung chỉ những tình trạng bất thường trong cấu trúc bẩm sinh của tim.","vi_duration":7.41,"en_audio":"speakers\/spk_001\/en\/000002.mp3","en_text":"Adult congenital heart disease, ACHD, is a general term referring to abnormal conditions in the heart's congenital structure.","en_duration":7.8,"reference_audio_ids":["spk_001_ref_combined","spk_001_ref_01","spk_001_ref_02","spk_001_ref_03","spk_001_ref_04","spk_001_ref_05","spk_001_ref_06","spk_001_ref_07","spk_001_ref_08","spk_001_ref_09"],"translation_model":"NLLB-200 \/ Helsinki-NLP","dubbing_provider":"ElevenLabs","dubbing_model":"eleven_multilingual_v2","speaker_similarity_vi_en":0.9768,"split":"train"}
{"pair_id":"spk_001_000003","speaker_id":"spk_001","gender":"male","original_source_speaker":"jellyfish1010_0046","vi_audio":"speakers\/spk_001\/vi\/000003.wav","vi_text":"Người có càng nhiều yếu tố nguy cơ thì nguy cơ mắc bệnh tim mạch càng cao.","vi_duration":7.05,"en_audio":"speakers\/spk_001\/en\/000003.mp3","en_text":"The more risk factors an individual has, the higher their risk of developing cardiovascular disease.","en_duration":5.67,"reference_audio_ids":["spk_001_ref_combined","spk_001_ref_01","spk_001_ref_02","spk_001_ref_03","spk_001_ref_04","spk_001_ref_05","spk_001_ref_06","spk_001_ref_07","spk_001_ref_08","spk_001_ref_09"],"translation_model":"NLLB-200 \/ Helsinki-NLP","dubbing_provider":"ElevenLabs","dubbing_model":"eleven_multilingual_v2","speaker_similarity_vi_en":0.9357,"split":"train"}
