{"pair_id":"spk_003_000002","speaker_id":"spk_003","gender":"female","original_source_speaker":"jellyfish1010_1017","vi_audio":"speakers\/spk_003\/vi\/000002.wav","vi_text":"Thậm chí có những em còn bị trói tay vào một cái vành đeo quanh cổ, còn chân thì bị trói vào đuôi giường một cách rất khó hiểu.","vi_duration":7.71,"en_audio":"speakers\/spk_003\/en\/000002.mp3","en_text":"Some children even had their hands tied to a collar around their neck, while their feet were tied to the foot of the bed in an incomprehensible way.","en_duration":9.06,"reference_audio_ids":["spk_003_ref_combined","spk_003_ref_01","spk_003_ref_02","spk_003_ref_03","spk_003_ref_04","spk_003_ref_05","spk_003_ref_06","spk_003_ref_07","spk_003_ref_08","spk_003_ref_09"],"translation_model":"NLLB-200 \/ Helsinki-NLP","dubbing_provider":"ElevenLabs","dubbing_model":"eleven_multilingual_v2","speaker_similarity_vi_en":0.9764,"split":"train"}
{"pair_id":"spk_003_000003","speaker_id":"spk_003","gender":"female","original_source_speaker":"jellyfish1010_1017","vi_audio":"speakers\/spk_003\/vi\/000003.wav","vi_text":"Theo cách hiểu của bà về từ này, điều đó có nghĩa là bà không thể đạt cực khoái trong tư thế truyền giáo.","vi_duration":7.13,"en_audio":"speakers\/spk_003\/en\/000003.mp3","en_text":"According to her understanding of the term, it meant that she could not achieve orgasm in the missionary position.","en_duration":6.18,"reference_audio_ids":["spk_003_ref_combined","spk_003_ref_01","spk_003_ref_02","spk_003_ref_03","spk_003_ref_04","spk_003_ref_05","spk_003_ref_06","spk_003_ref_07","spk_003_ref_08","spk_003_ref_09"],"translation_model":"NLLB-200 \/ Helsinki-NLP","dubbing_provider":"ElevenLabs","dubbing_model":"eleven_multilingual_v2","speaker_similarity_vi_en":0.9693,"split":"train"}
{"pair_id":"spk_003_000004","speaker_id":"spk_003","gender":"female","original_source_speaker":"jellyfish1010_1017","vi_audio":"speakers\/spk_003\/vi\/000004.wav","vi_text":"Trong mọi tử thi mà chúng tôi từng mổ cho đến nay, chúng tôi đều nhận thấy rằng nó khá dễ thấy và dễ chạm vào.","vi_duration":6.53,"en_audio":"speakers\/spk_003\/en\/000004.mp3","en_text":"In every autopsy we have performed to date, we found that it was relatively easy to see and touch.","en_duration":6.27,"reference_audio_ids":["spk_003_ref_combined","spk_003_ref_01","spk_003_ref_02","spk_003_ref_03","spk_003_ref_04","spk_003_ref_05","spk_003_ref_06","spk_003_ref_07","spk_003_ref_08","spk_003_ref_09"],"translation_model":"NLLB-200 \/ Helsinki-NLP","dubbing_provider":"ElevenLabs","dubbing_model":"eleven_multilingual_v2","speaker_similarity_vi_en":0.9694,"split":"train"}
